## Quick Commands Reference

Here are the one-liner commands to run this project:

```bash
# Initialize Terraform provider plugins
terraform init

# List all existing workspaces
terraform workspace list

# Create and switch to the 'urban' workspace
terraform workspace new urban

# Create and switch to the 'village' workspace
terraform workspace new village

# Switch back to an existing workspace
terraform workspace select urban

# Check which workspace is currently active
terraform workspace show

# Preview resources that will be created in the active workspace
terraform plan

# Deploy infrastructure in the active workspace
terraform apply -auto-approve

# Destroy resources in the current workspace only
terraform destroy -auto-approve
